<title>FRANCE: CDW ups DMC stake to 10.6 pct.</title>
<headline>CDW ups DMC stake to 10.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>DMC said on Wednesday Hong Kong textile group CDW international Ltd had increased its stake in the French textile manufacturer to 10.6 percent from 6.1 percent by exercising warrants.</p>
<p>DMC said in a statement the operation showed the desire of CDW to establish a long-term partnership with the French company.</p>
<p>CDW took the 6.1 percent stake in July last year and had warrants which could increase the stake to 16.3 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
